;;;; cocolog -- swipl 9.0.4's transparent and foreign predicates, for $/0
;;;
;;; GENERATED by tools/det/tables.pl under the reference swipl 9.0.4:
;;; 200 transparent and 453 foreign, Name and Arity, in standard order.
;;; Do not edit; run it again. A last call that takes a guarded frame
;;; over clears the frame's guard when the predicate it calls is
;;; transparent, as swipl's I_DEPART does (lib/solve-loop.cicili,
;;; `coco_det_transparent'), and a library predicate of cocolog's that
;;; swipl defines in C is one frame to the guard (`coco_det_opaque').

